    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Federal regulations require passengers to review\nthis important information for their safety.\nCalia Safere\nSécurité\nSicherheit\nSeguridad\nHAWALAN.\nThe Colors of Paradise.\nCARD SAFETY L1011\nL-1011 Tristar\nplease do not remove card from aircraft",
